From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ricktav <82380971+ricktav@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 15:38:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: sound: apple,s8000-mca: Add the S8000 TDM
 speaker link

The iPhone 6s Plus speaker amplifier sits on an 8-slot TDM link of MCA2.
Add a compatible for an A9 MCA that clocks that link itself from an AP
NCO channel, like the T8010 and T7001 speaker links.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: ricktav <82380971+ricktav@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,s8000-mca.yaml          | 6 +++++-
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,s8000-mca.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,s8000-mca.yaml
index 917689968..c2e15fcc5 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,s8000-mca.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,s8000-mca.yaml
@@ -17,7 +17,9 @@ description: |
   moved by SmartIO DMA. T8010 uses the same register layout (version 5),
   with an AP NCO bitclock: apple,t8010-mca is the playback-only digital
   speaker link (TDM), apple,t8010-mca-i2s the playback-only stereo I2S link
-  to the headphone codec. The MCAs are the same block; the compatible names
+  to the headphone codec. apple,s8000-mca-tdm is an A9 MCA driving its own
+  clocks from an AP NCO channel, the playback-only speaker link (TDM) of the
+  iPhone 6s Plus. The MCAs are the same block; the compatible names
   the link setup iOS programs into it. The T7001 (A8X) MCA is the older
   "mca-version 1" register layout with the same fields: apple,t7001-mca is
   the playback-only speaker link (TDM) of the iPad Air 2, clocked from an AP
@@ -32,6 +34,7 @@ allOf:
       properties:
         compatible:
           enum:
+            - apple,s8000-mca-tdm
             - apple,t7001-mca
             - apple,t8010-mca
             - apple,t8010-mca-i2s
@@ -54,6 +57,7 @@ properties:
     enum:
       - apple,s5l8960x-mca
       - apple,s8000-mca
+      - apple,s8000-mca-tdm
       - apple,t7001-mca
       - apple,t8010-mca
       - apple,t8010-mca-i2s
